# Agent working memory. Local by default: it is scratch state for an in-flight
# task, not project history. Comment this out if you want checkpoints to travel
# with the branch so reviewers can audit the agent's reasoning.
.kiro/.memory/

# Captured learnings staged for review before promotion into steering.
.kiro/.learnings/

# Redirected command output (see skill: token-efficiency)
*.buildlog
*.testlog
.kiro/.tmp/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
